Type: project
Package: nbaonequestion
Title: One Question at a Time: Bayesian Answers to NBA Questions
Version: 0.0.1
Description: Source for a weekly blog that asks and answers one question about
    the current NBA season using a Bayesian workflow. This file is not a
    package; it lists the project's dependencies for renv (explicit snapshots).
Depends:
    R (>= 4.3)
Imports:
